<li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":1999,"final_formatted":"$19.99 USD","initial":1999,"initial_formatted":""},"publishers":["Sandman Team"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa\r\nViol\u00eancia\r\nMedo","rating":"10","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"true"},"pegi":{"rating":"7"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"19 Jun, 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cNo matter how you look at Through the Nightmares, everything works well, from the great size-shifting mechanics to the haunting visuals and dramatic soundtrack that keep you going.\u201d<br>The Xbox Hub<br><br>\u201cThere\u2019s enough variety to the levels, both visual and otherwise, to keep things interesting, and Sandman Team does a good job of iterating on concepts in interesting ways while ensuring they don\u2019t overstay their welcome.\u201d<br>Shacknews<br><br>\u201cThrough the Nightmares is a nightmarishly difficult, great labour of love, with the only thing stopping you from beating the game is your own skill and willpower. Just be willing to wait, use any knowledge you collect with each death, and don\u2019t give up.\u201d<br>GameGrin<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266210/2c8da135413be043eb2e25e4939dfe6b16dd7cfc/ss_2c8da135413be043eb2e25e4939dfe6b16dd7cfc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766079118","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266210/2c8da135413be043eb2e25e4939dfe6b16dd7cfc/ss_2c8da135413be043eb2e25e4939dfe6b16dd7cfc.600x338.jpg?t=1766079118"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/